        "literal": "The sheet writes the opening U_s inclusion and barred-U nonemptiness expression, a U_s equality with an indexed large union and hatted positive Sigma, then a component condition and disjointness wording. It says “Il faut voir que” K setminus braced i and the Sigma-alpha-plus family are determined in terms of i and Sigma-i-plus, followed by “i.e.” Sigma-i-minus. The final written equality ends with E_alpha subset Sigma_alpha-minus and has no closing set brace. These are attributed manuscript expressions, not proof checks."
      },
      {
        "id": "S000386",
        "characters": 98,
        "utf8_bytes": 98,
        "sha256_utf8": "5db3dd2df9e15b488eab4595dbecf46109f425a9a050e7d60599de810049630e",
        "literal": "No title or date. Archive sheet number 24 at lower left; no manuscript page-number macro supplied."
      },
