        "characters": 179,
        "utf8_bytes": 179,
        "sha256_utf8": "3e8ef452ee5a50aa1833fa22e82516dd55cfb5c54835bfd075152eb6dda60304",
        "literal": "None. The final alpha, all signed forms and the unclosed brace are retained from their ink. No mathematical repair, inference, identity check or conditional theorem was performed."
      },
      {
        "id": "S000388",
        "characters": 270,
        "utf8_bytes": 271,
        "sha256_utf8": "0bc1e0e0c30718e44b9d0adceacee18de9456785155e4efaf3877f044e214c01",
        "literal": "H page24 corresponds to scan25 and has full text. H note apparatus is read with its body: repassé Sigma, malformed exponent, and disjoint-union description inform the witness collation; the note itself is not manuscript prose. H supplied expansion letters are editorial."
      },
      {
        "id": "S000389",
